        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 7052L, Wrought Steel Lafayette Lever with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique design of this Emtek made leverset is filled with old world charm. The Lafayette Leverset with Round Rose is as intricate as it is beautiful. Versatile, it will look great in a wide array of traditional style homes. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch thick doors and is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from passage, privacy, or dummy lever functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Wrought Steel Lafayette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Lafayette Lever with #2 Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
