                "description": "The unique design of this Emtek made leverset is filled with old world charm. The Lafayette Leverset with Round Rose is as intricate as it is beautiful. Versatile, it will look great in a wide array of traditional style homes. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch thick doors and is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from passage, privacy, or dummy lever functions.\r\n",
